+## 变更范围
+<!-- MACHINE-DRAFT:proposal-scope:9f4d55480c63142d065204de30bb408ced5181a64359fa82f9106c8aec0dd7b8:begin 机器预填段——整段改写会被 flow done 拒收；确要修改：sillyspec flow amend-draft --change 2026-10-03-fr-skeleton-gate 留痕重锚 -->
